<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:9pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Georgia,serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:9pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Georgia,serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hope you are off to a great start of the New Year! With Q1 in full swing, I wanted to see if you had time to go over a few different Strategies of how EverQuote can help assist with your goals, whether it is for Auto and Home or if you’re just looking to multiline.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:9pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Georgia,serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Great news - Our </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:9pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Georgia,serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Lead Connection Service (LCS)</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:9pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Georgia,serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"> which is new and available to State Farm Agents. This hybrid service combines live transfers with traditional data leads, connecting you directly with consumers who are qualified and ready for a quote. This is a proven system that has helped other carriers for over 4 years - now it's your turn to benefit. </span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:9pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Georgia,serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Additionally, we've introduced a new loyalty credit to our </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:9pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Georgia,serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Accelerated Growth Program (AGP)</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:9pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Georgia,serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"> customers - qualifying agents will receive an account credit on a monthly basis as a token of appreciation for your partnership. These tools are designed to help you start the year strong, and I want to make sure you are taking full advantage.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<br />
<br />
&nbsp;
<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:9pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Georgia,serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">For further information or should you have any questions on any additional information, feel free to reach me directly, my direct line is listed below or if it works better for you feel free to book time with me on my Calendar Link.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:9pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Georgia,serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">I look forward to speaking with you!</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:9pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Georgia,serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">All the best,&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:9pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Georgia,serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:none">Wileen R</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
